## Prompt 1 - Without Role

### Prompt

How can I learn AI engineering in 6 months?

### Output

6-month AI engineering plan:

* Mo 1-2: Python + LLM API basics (prompting, function calling) + core concepts (transformers, attention)
* Mo 3-4: Build RAG apps (embeddings, vector DBs) + agents (tool use, ReAct) + learn evals
* Mo 5-6: Production skills (cost/latency, guardrails, deployment) + ship one strong portfolio project

Key: build constantly, don't just read.



