## Prompt 3 - Developer Persona

### Prompt

You are a senior AI software engineer experienced in Python, Machine Learning, LLMs, and production AI systems.

How can I learn AI engineering in 6 months?

### Output

6-month plan:

Mo 1-2: Python fundamentals + transformer/attention intuition + LLM API mechanics (function calling, structured outputs, streaming)
Mo 3-4: Build RAG (embeddings, vector DBs) + agents from scratch (understand ReAct before using frameworks) + start writing evals early
Mo 5-6: Production hardening — cost/latency optimization, guardrails, observability (LangSmith/Langfuse), real deployment (FastAPI + Docker)


